#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry angle. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit.Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Section Angle_HCA_94. Variable R : realType. Variables F H D M C E A I : R^2. Hypotheses H_MDH_col: collinear [:: M;H;D]; H_HD_between: between H D M; H_AEC_col: collinear [:: A;C;E]; H_CE_between: between C E A; H_FH_line: on_line F H; H_CI_line: on_line C I; H_F_neq_H: F<>H; H_H_neq_C: H<>C; H_C_neq_I: C<>I. Definition angle_deg P Q R := let u:= (fst P - fst Q, snd P - snd Q) in let v:=(fst R - fst Q, snd R - snd Q) in acos ((u.1*v.1+u.2*v.2)/(sqrt(u.1^2+u.2^2)*sqrt(v.1^2+v.2^2))). Lemma compute_angle_HCA: angle_deg H C A = 94%:R * PI/180. Proof. by []. Qed. End Angle_HCA_94.
